OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud and isolated
OL,6,Fshowers to start, with hill fog over
OL,7,Fthe Pennines. Showers slowly dying out
OL,8,Fto leave a dry afternoon with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and bright evening
OL,13,Fbefore heavy rain and low cloud push
OL,14,Fnortheastwards with Storm Austen.
OL,15,FWindy for a time during the early
OL,16,Fhours the easing briefly towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
