OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of heavy and
OL,6,Fpersistent rain continue to move
OL,7,Fnortheastwards through the day. Winds
OL,8,Fquickly picking up through the morning
OL,9,Fwith gales likely along western coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStrong
OL,12,Fwinds and heavy rain Saturday before a
OL,13,Fbrief settled interlude brings sunny
OL,14,Fspells and isolated light showers on
OL,15,FSunday. Further wind and rain arrives
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
